ll,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"１. 配合完成公司代理产品线（MCU/MPU、模拟器件、电源管理、传感器、存储、显示驱动等方向）的市场开拓和客户现场技术支持工作，包括售前推广、售中的技术支持、售后不良问题跟进与原厂端的沟通。\n２. 深入理解客户技术需求，协同销售、BD与产品经理挖掘项目机会。\n３. 与原厂技术团队保持紧密沟通，维护原厂端合作关系。\n４. 定期拜访客户，跟踪项目进度，撰写技术方案书、FAQ等，并进行内部的有效沟通、培训。\n５. 收集市场竞品信息与客户反馈，为公司产品线规划及备货策略提供技术输入。","Require":"１. 本科及以上学历，电子、通信、计算机、自动化、微电子等相关理工科专业，经验丰富者可适当放宽。\n２. 3年以上电子行业硬件从业经验，有芯片原厂或大型代理商FAE工作经验优先。\n３. 具备一定的英语读写能力，能阅读英文datasheet及技术文档。\n４. 具备良好的沟通能力、团队协作精神、工作态度，有一定的抗压能力。\n\n工作地点：北京、上海、深圳","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-14T14:52:36","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"bd139489-df0f-40fb-884d-528441ad4a16","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":470018528,"PostDateInt":1791771893000,"PostDate":"2026-10-12T10:24:53","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime